[{"id":4235516410,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc78dNn6","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Makes sense to me.\n\n`metadata_properties` was introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/59452. As far as I can tell, it was meant to be an optimization for the `set` and `get` case (not needing a substring).\n\n3 reasons why I I think `metadata_properties` is premature optimization:\n1. `starts_with` is not meaningfully slower (probably faster) than hash lookup, in the 'miss' path. Regular property access will not be slower.\n2. `set` metadata is likely faster through this change than before (less hash lookups).\n3. The fast path to get metadata is `get_meta`. The regular property getter is a convenience method and is overshadowed by the rest of `get` anyway — this won't make a difference.\n\nThe only caveat to (1) is that we make an unnecessary `String` copy here, which increments and decrements an atomic. This is unavoidable until https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118856 is merged. I'd prefer if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118856 was merged first to avoid a lookup regression from this.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117447#pullrequestreview-4235516410","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117447","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117447#pullrequestreview-4235516410"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117447"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-06T11:15:26Z","commit_id":"07087136771fee586db346d519b86cf43981b12c"},{"id":4236451985,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc78gyCR","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Assuming #118856 will be merged first...\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117447#pullrequestreview-4236451985","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117447","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117447#pull